                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": 720,
                                      "content": "Three things since 01:40. Sakartvelo’s backend finished the migration branch and is idle with an unmerged worktree. 1212-Capital’s qa has been on a permission dialog for 26 minutes: it is stuck on you, not on the work. And tars’ frontend has rewritten the same file four times, which usually means it is looping.",
