                                      "width": 720,
                                      "content": "Morning. Two changes before anyone touches the queue again. First, the count on an agent’s row comes from the bus and not from the renderer, so the two can never disagree about how many messages wait. Second, a message to the whole room lands in each queue on its own, and each copy says who it was for. Backend first, then frontend, then qa.",
