                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "content": "WHAT IS DRAWN",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.8
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zbPzW",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Each room state is a whole page, dark on the left and light beside it: at rest, one agent busy, one stopped, everyone stopped, an agent that errors, a long thread scrolled up, every delivery state, the team folded, members joining and leaving, nothing said yet with how it runs open, a room with no agents, and the bus not answering.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "u1jMw",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Hermes is the global room: answering, paused after a write it sent, not connected, nothing said yet, and the first run, with nothing to watch.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "iop3f",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Three sheets hold every row and card on its own: the team, the thread and Hermes. The composer’s states are the sheet approved with it.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "wEufW",
          "name": "Decided while drawing",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "AsUOS",
              "name": "baseline +1",
              "padding": [
                2,
                0,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eSzg3",
                  "name": "PanelCaption",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "content": "DECIDED WHILE DRAWING",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.8
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NEBPm",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Stop shows only while the room relays. At rest, or with everyone stopped, there is nothing to stop.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "aTPH7",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Held is not not sent. Held: something is typed in the agent’s field, so Tars could not type the message in; it goes in by itself once that field is sent or cleared. Not sent: the agent has no end of turn or no session, and the message waits for you.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "hewgV",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A delivered line carries no tag. Your own line always lists its receipts, all of them.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "AA88R",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "ROOMS and TEAM fold from their header. The folded team keeps its counts, and its + comes back when it opens.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "N78au",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "An open row shows its state’s action first, then write, which picks the agent in the composer, then more: stop, restart, remove from room. write to qa became write, because longer names did not fit.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "OA9ol",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The needs-you strip shows three rows at most, then show N more.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "eYHtR",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "An agent’s detail says when it last spoke. The bus never stores a silence, so passed at could not be read from anything.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vaz1y",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "docs says no turn signal, the word the composer’s picker already uses.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "mzjVl",
          "name": "Alignment",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "t00uWC",
              "name": "baseline +1",
              "padding": [
                2,
                0,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "p2Ukb",
                  "name": "PanelCaption",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "content": "ALIGNMENT",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.8
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "XwDOp",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Measured with the pen CLI, never by eye. Every size and offset below is a multiple of 4, except the shell's own tokens: sidebar 216, header 84 with 22/26/14/26, content 0/26/22/26, and the 10 between the two columns.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YpOQP",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The left column has one text column, 36 from its edge. Every row leads with a 16px slot at 12 (a status square, a chevron, an agent mark or an icon), then 8, then its text. Rows are 52 (Hermes and rooms), 56 (agents), 32 (captions and what Hermes can reach).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "InvsQ",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The panel has two edges and one body column: content starts 24 from the panel edge and ends 24 before it; times and the strips' squares sit at 24, and message text, strip text, cards, notices and the pending row start at 72. Highlighted rows (your lines, the needs-you strip, the new messages band) are full-width bands, so no box adds an edge.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LslDk",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "In the needs-you strip, the action sits in a 96px slot, right-aligned, so every since label ends at the same x whatever the button.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t1Ev22",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The composer's text and its + share x 24, and send ends 24 from the card's edge, the same edges as the panel above it. Lines are 16 (rows, captions, labels) or 20 (message text, names over messages, the field).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Masdt",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A thread starts under its head. Once it is longer than the panel, the view follows its newest message, so the room shows no empty band under its head, and neither does Hermes.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "h0utX4",
          "name": "Not in the bus yet",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "A8whkp",
              "name": "baseline +1",
              "padding": [
                2,
                0,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "iMCVv",
                  "name": "PanelCaption",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "content": "NOT IN THE BUS YET",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.8
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "e9KMto",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Held as a delivery state, the counts per member, who joined or left on a members change, and starting for a member that joined. The pull request lists each one with the field it needs.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
